  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wetskills competition South-Africa CCMC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Wetskills competitions will bring diverse young talents from South Africa, Southern Africa and beyond with a passion for Water &amp; Sustainability together to co-create new solutions for water challenges in a two week period. In an interactive and intergenerational workshop, the teams will present their innovative and out-of-the-box solutions for water challenges to a jury panel and audience. The winning team will be awarded at the closing ceremony of the CoCreateMYCITY event in Durban on 8 June 2023 (PKB23ZA02A).This project is related to project PKB23ZA02A as five high-potential candidates from the Wetskills programme will be provided with a tailor-made mentorship programme to improve the market readiness of their business ideas.The programme will be conducted via the incubation programmes from Orange Corners with local market knowledge.</narrative>
  </description>
